    skos:definition "The subject plays the role the object names, in the context the supporting text gives."@en-AU ;
    tmk:reading "<role holder> acts as <role>"@en-AU ;
    skos:example "At examination the examiner acts as the decision maker."@en-AU ;
    tmk:counterExample "Not for a kind of; an examiner is a kind of delegate (broader) and acts as the decision maker."@en-AU ;
